                <h4 class="media-heading">Piston Compressors</h4>
                <p>Chicago Pneumatic <a href="@Url.Action("Electric", "ChicagoPneumatic")">piston compressors</a> are great in applications where compressed air requirements are low. With a diverse product range their piston compressors are available in many versions, making them suited to any production activity. Mobile, low- or high-pressure, on-frame or vessel-mounted, they are designed to meet intermittent compressed air demands.</p>
                <h4 class="media-heading">Quiet Rotary Screw</h4>
                <p>Engineered for high performance, efficiency and reliability, the Chicago Pneumatic line of <a href="@Url.Action("RotaryScrew", "ChicagoPneumatic")">QRS (Quiet Rotary Screw)</a> air compressors can meet the compressed air demands of a tire shop, maintenance shop, vehicle body, paint shop or automotive dealership. These compressors are known throughout the industry as being top of the line products, and can deliver continuous air supply when needed.</p>
            </div>
